				"description": "OOPs - Handwritten Notes (Concept\nMade Simple)\nOOPs programming ka core foundation hai\nJava, C++, Python - sab jagah OOP concepts use hote hain.\n\nIn these handwritten notes, you'll learn:\n👉What is OOPs & why we use it\n👉Class & Object\n👉Inheritance\n👉Polymorphism\n👉Encapsulation\n  👉 Abstraction\n  👉Real-life examples + diagrams\n  👉Notes are designed to be:\n  👉Simple language\n  👉Clean handwritten format\n  👉Diagram based explanation\n  👉Exam & interview oriented",
